sequenceDiagram
    actor Tester
    participant Panel as Voice prompts page / artisan
    participant Abena as Abena AI TTS
    participant FF as AudioTranscoder (ffmpeg)
    participant Store as Public storage
    participant Bundle as Committed bundle
    participant DB as Database
    Tester->>Panel: 1. edit wording, then sparkle button or voice-prompts:synthesize
    Panel->>Abena: 2. POST /tts/synthesize (text, voice abena_twi_high / mawuli_ewe)
    Abena-->>Panel: 3. Base64 WAV (503 at capacity - wait Retry-After and retry)
    Panel->>FF: 4. convert to MP3 (browser) and 8 kHz WAV (IVR)
    FF->>Store: 5. voice-prompts/{function}/{step}/{language}/
    Panel->>DB: 6. save audio_path and telephony_audio_path
    Tester->>Bundle: 7. voice-prompts:export - manifest.json plus audio, commit to git
    Bundle->>DB: 8. db:seed on a fresh install - recreate prompts and copy audio
